        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion E D1, Navajo Solid Brass Entry Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNavajo Decorative Keyed Entry Plate Fusion-E-D1 - Made with southwest styling, Fusion Hardware's Navajo Entry Plate is cast from solid brass. It is available in Antique pewter, Brushed nickel, or Antique Copper Finishes. With standard 5-1/2 inch on center door boring, it will fit most pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/navajo-keyed-entry-plate-fusion-e-d1\"><b>More Knob and Lever Choices</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Navajo Entry Set Fusion D1\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Forging and Castings</li>\r\n<li>Bump Resistant Cylinder</li> \r\n<li>Solid Brass SC1 Keyway and 5 Pin System with Self Lubricating Solid Brass Plug & Housing</li>\r\n<li>High security strike</li> \r\n<li> Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation</li>\r\n<li>Matching Latch, Strike and screws for excellent appearance</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used</li>\r\n<li>Dual Spring Assist - to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Southwest Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>One year finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Navajo Series Keyed Entry Plate, Fusion-E-D1",
                "description": "Navajo Decorative Keyed Entry Plate Fusion-E-D1 - Made with southwest styling, Fusion Hardware's Navajo Entry Plate is cast from solid brass. It is available in Antique pewter, Brushed nickel, or Antique Copper Finishes. With standard 5-1/2 inch on center door boring, it will fit most pre-drilled doors. ",
